5) Connect Instance:

Connect to one node (inside Docker, no install needed). Run from the galera-lab folder:

docker compose exec node1 mariadb -uroot -prompts
docker compose exec node1 mariadb -uroot -prootpass
Use node2 or node3 for the other nodes.

Connect from your Mac. Install a client with brew install mariadb, or use DBeaver or MySQL Workbench:

mariadb -h 127.0.0.1 -P 3307 -uroot -prootpass   # node1
mariadb -h 127.0.0.1 -P 3308 -uroot -prootpass   # node2
mariadb -h 127.0.0.1 -P 3309 -uroot -prootpass   # node3

